    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tx32](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tx32) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Nov 09 2026 12km NW of Bula. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -3.0627 longitude 130.3905. It impacted 43590 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
